              "type": "text",
              "text": "In class tests this year, Juan has so far scored 75, 69, 81 and 87. If he wants to get an average of 80 after his next test, what score does Juan need to get?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p19-q9-shared-instruction",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
