    "answer": {
      "short": "88",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be Juan’s next test score. His first four scores total $75+69+81+87=312$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{312+x}{5}&=80\\\\312+x&=400\\\\x&=88\\end{align*}$$\n\nJuan needs to score 88.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
